OL,3,GNEWSAThousands attend balloon festival
OL,4,Anight launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people turned out for a
OL,7,Fnight launch ahead of Telford's Balloon
OL,8,FFestival this weekend.
OL,10,FThe Night Glow event in Telford town
OL,11,Fpark also included live music and
OL,12,Factivities for families, including an
OL,13,Fappearance by Mr Motivator.
OL,15,FMore entertainment is planned around
OL,16,Fthe QEII Arena on Saturday and Sunday,
OL,17,Falthough a jump by the Wings Parachute
OL,18,FDisplay Team had to be called off on
OL,19,FSaturday, because of the wet weather.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
