OL,3,GNEWSAThousands attend balloon festival
OL,4,Anight launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were due to be more balloon
OL,7,Flaunches on Saturday and Sunday but
OL,8,FSaturday night's launch had to be
OL,9,Fcalled off because of the weather. Five
OL,10,Flarge green alien balloons were
OL,11,Finflated and went on show to the
OL,12,Fpublic, tethered to the ground.
